  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COCAHU seeks to expand the quantity of quality of coffee produced by building infrastructure, increasing the capacity of their pulping machine, increase the number of drying bed, and training their members in good agriculture and processing techniques.</narrative>
